afHom^\\bullet((\\mathcal{L}')^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet))\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 461, "start": 299}, "source_hash": "sha256:a651c2ab0bcbbaf24ca425d166e227adf6d7dcc943ddfbed389d813d5766f827"}], "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0A8X", "placeholders": {"MATHSEG_0001": "$$\nH^0(\\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet, (\\mathcal{I}')^\\bullet))\n\\quad\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\\quad\nH^0(\\SheafHom^\\bullet((\\mathcal{L}')^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet))\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$M$", "MATH_0002": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{I}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\mathcal{I}')^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$L$", "MATH_0006": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\mathcal{L}')^\\bullet$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nU \\longmapsto \\Hom_{D(\\mathcal{O}_U)}(L|_U, M|_U)\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-RHom-into-K-injective}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9b02885a9de64d5911dd2669826812884f753562fa3556e4d99712b332449472", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:246ecaad2f0c94653d10444a1a30af3179c734c888ce8759d03cb188b1edd3da", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c75be6325ba43c141595e7ba7baacd7826bd691bdfaeaf11a9f9785f7a76f8c6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be the object of <MATH_0002> represented by\n<MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be the object of <MATH_0006> represented by\n<MATH_0007> and <MATH_0008>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that the sheaves\n<MATHSEG_0001>and<MATHSEG_0002>\nare both equal to the sheaf associated to the presheaf\n<MATH_0009>\nThus the map is a quasi-isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e78061118aba8040b7161abbdfcd63111c298e1a12c054e30c865847781392ca", "unit_id": "tag:0A95:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0A8X", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{I}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-RHom-from-K-flat-into-K-injective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9d72309d108c335ec00f7b3f32abf0b565296e82b311767e28ca7948c39dcd2d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a37cca4c6f86446d50e51201be4cadf6f361c75fdade29e20a2771cbef1853b7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a K-injective complex of <MATH_0003>-modules. Let\n<MATH_0004> be a K-flat complex of <MATH_0005>-modules.\nThen <MATH_0006>\nis a K-injective complex of <MATH_0007>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a3f09721e9aaf7761ef875ef93bf5f4ddcc52219756a465538398f9dd851a500", "unit_id": "tag:0A96:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0A8X", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0003": "\\begin{align*}\n\\Hom_{K(\\mathcal{O})}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet,\n\\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet))\n& =\nH^0(\\Gamma(\\mathcal{C},\n\\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet,\n\\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet, \\mathcal{I}^\\bullet)))) \\\\\n& =\nH^0(\\Gamma(\\mathcal{C}, \\SheafHom^\\bullet(\\text{Tot}(\n\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet),\n\\mathcal{I}^\\bullet))) \\\\\n& =\n\\Hom_{K(\\mathcal{O})}(\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet),\n\\mathcal{I}^\\bullet) \\\\\n& =\n0\n\\end{align*}", "MATH_0004": "$\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet)$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{I}^\\bullet$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-global-cohomology-hom-complex}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-compose}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{equation-global-cohomology-hom-complex}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{definition-K-flat}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b792dd1c143731ebeb86bd84d72d2bacd2cac69d06c3417d9459344b339d2daf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5aa7a17d044c778758a927e5a95e5f03bacfcae4b6894d37295fa7be3fce9245", "source_text": "Namely, if <MATH_0001> is an acyclic complex of\n<MATH_0002>-modules, then\n<MATH_0003>\nThe first equality by (<REF_0001>).\nThe second equality by Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThe third equality by (<REF_0003>).\nThe final equality because\n<MATH_0004>\nis acyclic because <MATH_0005> is K-flat\n(Definition <REF_0004>) and because <MATH_0006>\nis K-injective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cf9268222cad11d49b60a622972a4a64e82c8f